meta {
  name: Verify Finding Progress
  type: http
  seq: 1
}
patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/{{issueId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}
auth:bearer {
  token: {{reviewerToken}}
}
body:json {
  {
    "status":"in_progress",
    "comment":"Verified the recorded finding against the exact candidate and evidence.",
    "reviewAssessment":{
      "baselineDecisionId":{{baselineDecisionIdJson}},
      "candidateRef":"{{candidateRef}}",
      "evidenceRefs":["{{evidenceRef}}"],
      "openFindingIds":[],
      "requiredGateIds":[],
      "resolvedFindingIds":["{{findingId}}"],
      "passedGateIds":[]
    }
  }
}
docs {
  Existing compatible task API. Enable reviewGuard.mode=progress as board while preserving the complete policy.
  GET the task first. Use the current stage reviewer's credential and lastDecisionId; register a finding in an earlier assessment before resolving it.
  Set baselineDecisionIdJson to a JSON-quoted UUID for later decisions. For the initial assessment use actual JSON null for baselineDecisionIdJson only when task.lastDecisionId is null, empty resolvedFindingIds/passedGateIds, and register openFindingIds/requiredGateIds.
  These evidence references attest reviewer verification, not execution authority. Do not rerun unchanged tests or retry 409/422 automatically.
}
